    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "mlSlo",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Motion Notes",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280,
      "content": "Apple motion\n\nButton/Primary: highlight on pointer-down, scale 0.97, 100ms. Never wait for click.\n\nSheets and drawers: spring damping 1.0, response 0.3. Interruptible from the live transform.\n\nPhoto grid: rubber-band at edges; project flick with d=0.998 then spring.\n\nChat: 1:1 with the pointer while dragging the thread; bounce only after a flick."
    }
